# Voicebox Boundary

- Treat `Voicebox` as a local operator-side tooling asset, not governed repo content.
- If present near the workspace, keep it in a sibling folder such as `C:\Apps\github_repos\Voicebox\`, not inside `aios-governing-docs`.
- Never add Voicebox paths, profiles, renders, or prompts to governed manifests, required knowledge inputs, or peer-review exports.
- Never let Voicebox become part of authoring, architect, UI, committee, peer-review, kernel, or ratification decision logic.
- Any mention inside this repo stays descriptive only: optional local narration/render support outside the governed repo boundary.
